flowchart LR
    subgraph User
        A[Open Scans page] --> B{New Scan?}
        B -->|Yes| C[Select scan type]
        C --> C2[Apply filters: set, format, rarity]
        C2 --> D[Click Start Scan]
        B -->|No| G
    end
    subgraph System
        D --> E[POST /api/v1/scans]
        E --> F[Background scan runs]
        F --> F2[Per-card: fetch price, store observation]
        F2 --> F3[Update scan_run metrics]
        F3 --> G[Scan appears in history]
    end
    subgraph Review[User Reviews]
        G --> H[View scan details]
        H --> I[Check cards processed / failed / observations]
        I --> J{Errors?}
        J -->|Yes| K[Review error summary]
        J -->|No| L[Done]
    end
